#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:5
#: e23fe7b95d62455db3830e693774207c
msgid "DroneCAN Adapter Setup"
msgstr "DroneCAN 适配器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:7
#: 2d0f0cd269f14f21bc4c48d9d6b0f624
msgid ""
"These are several ways that a DroneCAN adapter node running AP_Periph can be"
" used and this page is a small selection of the possibilities. These "
"sections should walk you through setting up the autopilot and the node so "
"that they work together."
msgstr ""
"运行 AP_Periph 的 DroneCAN 适配器节点有多种使用方式，本页仅列举部分可能性。以下各节将引导您完成飞控和节点的设置，使其协同工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:9
#: 6b90588f7a34474c8e951f79ed6d199e
msgid ""
"DroneCAN Adapter nodes usually come with firmware that supports a subset of "
"ArduPilot's large peripheral capability. Be sure to check that the firmware "
"supplied supports the peripherals you are attemptime to setup. If not, check"
" the `Firmware <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/>`__  page for "
"possible alternative firmware for that adapter that may have the capability."
msgstr ""
"DroneCAN 适配器节点通常随附支持 ArduPilot 大量外设功能子集的固件。请确认所附固件支持您要配置的外设。如不支持，请查看 `固件 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/>`__ 页面，寻找该适配器是否有具备相关功能的替代固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:12
#: 192e652643f14e4bbb0e4c6d849bb576
msgid "GPS Setup"
msgstr "GPS 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:13
#: e26e5e5f17174d05939f2b3cfe374b7e
msgid "Attach the GPS to a DroneCAN Adapter's serial port"
msgstr "将 GPS 连接到 DroneCAN 适配器的串口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:15
#: 5b4a95efa4644d0182cece7ee4b1670f
msgid "set :ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 9 on the autopilot"
msgstr "在飞控上设置 :ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 9"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:16
#: 4c25df0c922744e18edbc7dbf3e4be5d
msgid ""
"set the DroneCAN adapter's ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` on which the GPS is "
"connected to 5 (GPS)"
msgstr "将 DroneCAN 适配器上连接 GPS 的 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 设置为 5（GPS）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:19
#: 0f30ae6cf50c41738be07164242531dc
msgid "Compass Setup"
msgstr "罗盘设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:20
#: 631aa4acb5a7412e8f6b9e4ff1fa62ba
msgid ""
"Attach the Compass to the DroneCAN Adapter's external I2C port. It will "
"appear as a normal Compass in ArduPilot and normal :ref:`compass setup "
"procedures<common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>` would apply."
msgstr ""
"将罗盘连接到 DroneCAN 适配器的外置 I2C 端口。它将在 ArduPilot 中显示为普通罗盘，并适用标准的 "
":ref:`罗盘校准流程<common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:22
#: 4b709005a781483e8a48014364ae89d0
msgid ""
"The MatekL431 CAN Adapter comes setup for a SPI connected Compass (RM3100). "
"If an I2C Compass is attached, different firmware must be loaded for it to "
"function."
msgstr "MatekL431 CAN 适配器出厂配置用于 SPI 连接的罗盘（RM3100）。如果连接 I2C 罗盘，必须加载其他固件才能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:25
#: af1685ffbffd4d37b57d2816e969bccb
msgid "I2C Airspeed Sensor"
msgstr "I2C 空速传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:26
#: 018592ab0b6c47e999f818e5c8d656ed
msgid "Attach to the I2C bus pinned out from the DroneCAN Adapter."
msgstr "连接到 DroneCAN 适配器引出的 I2C 总线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:28
#: 267258e4d6ad4bc3bc357dc1221cd0a6
msgid "set :ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` =8 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` = 8（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:29
#: 888c6133f82a403fac67c03f2ca675a3
msgid ""
"set the DroneCAN's ``ARSPD_TYPE`` parameter to match the type of airspeed "
"sensor connected."
msgstr "将 DroneCAN 的 ``ARSPD_TYPE`` 参数设置为匹配所连接的空速传感器类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:32
#: 5c88ee65f2344717977d8e614c7dbfb3
msgid "Rangefinder Setup"
msgstr "测距仪设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:33
#: d783786646884bff8be1079ced909699
msgid ""
"To use rangefinders, follow the instructions at  :ref:`DroneCAN Setup "
"Advanced<common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` to set up the ArduPilot parameters. "
"Using MissionPlanner or DroneCAN Gui, set the parameters on the adaptor node"
" following the instructions for the relevant rangefinder."
msgstr ""
"要使用测距仪，请按照 :ref:`DroneCAN 高级设置<common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` 中的说明配置 "
"ArduPilot 参数。使用 MissionPlanner 或 DroneCAN GUI，按照相应测距仪的说明在适配器节点上设置参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:35
#: 3fb92f3f49d14fe3b8de5dc237c70572
msgid ""
"The orientation of the rangefinder (RNGFND1_ORIENT) must be set to 0 on the "
"adaptor node."
msgstr "测距仪的方向（RNGFND1_ORIENT）必须在适配器节点上设置为 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:37
#: 2f1c4891bcfa4d5aad2ac4f33b38f6d9
msgid ""
"The RNGFNDx_ADDR ArduPilot parameter must be set above 0 and be equal to the"
" number set on the DroneCAN adapter node."
msgstr "ArduPilot 中的 RNGFNDx_ADDR 参数必须设置为大于 0 且等于 DroneCAN 适配器节点上设置的编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:40
#: 7947ea4f05a3487097578163d09333ea
msgid "PWM or DShot Output Node"
msgstr "PWM 或 DShot 输出节点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:41
#: 5584648de3704857bf03630a88466a02
msgid ""
"Adapters that have timer outputs available can be used as PWM and DShot "
"output nodes."
msgstr "具有定时器输出的适配器可用作 PWM 和 DShot 输出节点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:43
#: cbeceb6aff3a4ca68b3ccb7aa687c1e9
msgid ""
"The `MatekL431 DroneCAN PWM device "
"<https://www.mateksys.com/?portfolio=can-l4-pwm>`__ is an example of this."
msgstr ""
"`MatekL431 DroneCAN PWM 设备 "
"<https://www.mateksys.com/?portfolio=can-l4-pwm>`__ 是一个示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:45
#: bcb17a9de32648dda9210ffd2a4f7ca5
msgid ""
"This can be useful for providing additional servo outputs beyond what the "
"autopilot provides, but is most useful for allowing the ESCs and Sevos to be"
" remotely located, far from the autopilot using the CAN bus to communicate. "
"A maximum of 32 outputs in ArduPilot is possible."
msgstr ""
"这对于在飞控提供的舵机输出之外增加额外输出很有用，但最主要的用途是允许 ESC 和舵机远离飞控，通过 CAN 总线进行通信。ArduPilot 最多支持"
" 32 路输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:47
#: a5ff1df64f8a47d0938442dd9d23efe8
msgid ""
"In addition, the autopilot outputs can be configured for GPIO use, and still"
" allow up to 32 servo/motor outputs to be realized with DroneCAN "
"peripherals."
msgstr "此外，飞控输出可以配置为 GPIO 用途，同时仍允许通过 DroneCAN 外设实现多达 32 路舵机/电机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:49
#: 76c1adb0845541348bcf480b71c57127
msgid ""
"In order to use DShot output, the node must have a DShot-capable firmware "
"installed."
msgstr "要使用 DShot 输出，节点必须安装支持 DShot 的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:52
#: 43d84c38776a4b63a6c4902508bce669
msgid "DShot ESC Adapter"
msgstr "DShot ESC 适配器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:53
#: c9795178052a4901ac2dac4f39e4ade7
msgid ""
"In this example, a quadplane with outputs 5-8 used for 4 DShot ESCs with "
"telemetry will be shown. 3 wires from each ESC should be connected to the "
"DroneCAN adapter node: Ground, DShot signal, and serial telemetry. The "
"ground from each ESC should be connected to a ground pad on the DroneCAN "
"node. The signal wires from the 4 ESCs should be connected to the first 4 "
"PWM pads on the node, marked as outputs “1”, “2”, “3”, and “4”. The serial "
"telemetry pin from all 4 ESCs should be all connected to the same UART RX "
"pin on the adapter node."
msgstr ""
"本示例展示一架使用输出 5-8 连接 4 个带数传 DShot ESC 的四旋翼固定翼飞机。每个 ESC 的 3 根线应连接到 DroneCAN "
"适配器节点：地线、DShot 信号线和串口数传线。每个 ESC 的地线应连接到 DroneCAN 节点上的地焊盘。4 个 ESC "
"的信号线应分别连接到节点上标记为 「1」、「2」、「3」、「4」 的前 4 个 PWM 焊盘。所有 4 个 ESC "
"的串口数传引脚应全部连接到适配器节点上的同一个 UART RX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:55
#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:69
#: 370fdbabffdb4efbbb3933e5666392af 999d3b10cde34921bc98632fed9d129a
msgid "On the main autopilot you need to set:"
msgstr "在主飞控上需要设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:57
#: 47931621adc9437caf4e68c15616c40b
msgid ":ref:`CAN_Px_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_Px_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:58
#: 53fee09e274d4d3ab82a163c4314a229
msgid ":ref:`CAN_Dx_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_Dx_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:59
#: 8bcb8f8a4b434e399200462ec1c0a817
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_Dx_UC_ESC_BM <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` = 240 or the bitmask of motor "
"outputs"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_Dx_UC_ESC_BM <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` = 240 或电机输出的位掩码"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:60
#: 02430aab9cc243aab25d84cb73a5a25d
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_Dx_UC_ESC_OF <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF>` = 4 or the offset number to the "
"first ESC output. This makes the transmission of CAN packets much more "
"efficient"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_Dx_UC_ESC_OF <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF>` = 4 或第一个 ESC 输出的偏移量。这可以大幅提高 CAN "
"数据包传输效率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:62
#: c735a5b393fd461086550eedc9c7fbe1
msgid "On the DroneCAN PWM node you need to set:"
msgstr "在 DroneCAN PWM 节点上需要设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:64
#: cc844168130a427e86ce6d14efbb4891
msgid ":ref:`OUTx_FUNCTION <dev:OUT1_FUNCTION>` = 33 + ESC number"
msgstr ":ref:`OUTx_FUNCTION <dev:OUT1_FUNCTION>` = 33 + ESC 编号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:65
#: 48839e17f6f44512b84500aee1bb5986
msgid ""
":ref:`OUT_BLH_MASK <dev:OUT_BLH_MASK>` = 15 or a bitmask of which ESCs are "
"active"
msgstr ":ref:`OUT_BLH_MASK <dev:OUT_BLH_MASK>` = 15 或活动 ESC 的位掩码"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:68
#: f61b315b8366491cb05aa6daf02c26bf
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:71
#: dc5a9790b8fe4a139fc86246544f8b18
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_Dx_UC_SRV_BM <CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM>` to a bitmask of servos you want "
"to send over CAN."
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_Dx_UC_SRV_BM <CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM>` 设为您想通过 CAN 发送的舵机位掩码。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:72
#: b5ca68d34424444cbe5d19a767313d1e
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_Dx_UC_SRV_RT <CAN_D1_UC_SRV_RT>` to the output rate. This is "
"typically 50 Hz for most servos."
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_Dx_UC_SRV_RT <CAN_D1_UC_SRV_RT>` 设为输出频率。大多数舵机通常为 50Hz。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:74
#: 373c17550fe640229ff481c1699b02a3
msgid "On the CAN node you need to set:"
msgstr "在 CAN 节点上需要设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:76
#: 09c33f227a054b978a89e4d3051b3058
msgid ":ref:`OUT_BLH_MASK <dev:OUT_BLH_MASK>` = 0 to disable DShot"
msgstr ":ref:`OUT_BLH_MASK <dev:OUT_BLH_MASK>` = 0 以禁用 DShot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:77
#: 61b1abcbbd754d7f92eb475e92f646cb
msgid ":ref:`ESC_PWM_TYPE <dev:ESC_PWM_TYPE>` = 0 for normal PWM"
msgstr ":ref:`ESC_PWM_TYPE <dev:ESC_PWM_TYPE>` = 0 用于普通 PWM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:78
#: 2655c0751e1349fa9b2404db153d4951
msgid ""
":ref:`OUTx_FUNCTION <dev:OUT1_FUNCTION>` to a value of 50 plus the servo "
"number for each output you want to be enabled as PWM output"
msgstr ""
":ref:`OUTx_FUNCTION <dev:OUT1_FUNCTION>` 设为 50 加上舵机编号，对应每个您希望启用为 PWM 输出的输出端"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:79
#: ce7b46a41212461684a6f1fde3b774c1
msgid ""
":ref:`OUTx_FUNCTION <dev:OUT1_FUNCTION>` = 0 for any outputs you do not have"
" connected. Do not leave them at the default of 33 + ESC number"
msgstr ""
":ref:`OUTx_FUNCTION <dev:OUT1_FUNCTION>` = 0 用于任何未连接的输出。不要保留默认值 33 + ESC 编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:81
#: 74e25e377ccf4aa08f39f4713a201aff
msgid ""
"For example, if you had an elevator servo on SERVO2 on the main autopilot "
"and you want this to appear on the first output of the CAN node (on the "
"node's pin marked “1”) then you would set OUT1_FUNCTION = 52 (that is 50 + "
"the servo number on the autopilot). If you wanted a rudder that is on SERVO4"
" to appear on output 4 then you would set OUT4_FUNCTION=54."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果升降舵舵机在主飞控的 SERVO2 上，您希望它出现在 CAN 节点的第一路输出（节点上标记为 「1」 的引脚）上，则设置 "
"OUT1_FUNCTION = 52（即 50 加上飞控上的舵机编号）。如果方向舵在 SERVO4 上，希望出现在输出 4 上，则设置 "
"OUT4_FUNCTION = 54。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:83
#: 24067084bb854922b9bbfaa0157573b8
msgid ""
"It is also recommended to set OUTn_MIN to 1000, OUTn_MAX to 2000, and "
"OUTn_TRIM to 1500. That will allow you to use the SERVOn_MIN, SERVOn_MAX, "
"and SERVOn_TRIM values on the main autopilot to control the outputs range "
"and center in the usual way. It is possible to use other values on the node,"
" but it gets more complicated to understand the mapping of the PWM values, "
"so using 1000, 1500, 2000 is recommended. Doing this also means the PWM "
"value in your autopilot logs matches what is output by the node."
msgstr ""
"还建议将 OUTn_MIN 设置为 1000，OUTn_MAX 设置为 2000，OUTn_TRIM 设置为 "
"1500。这样就可以像通常那样使用主飞控上的 SERVOn_MIN、SERVOn_MAX 和 SERVOn_TRIM "
"值来控制输出范围和中点。节点上可以使用其他值，但理解 PWM 值映射关系会更复杂，因此推荐使用 1000、1500、2000。这样做还意味着飞控日志中的"
" PWM 值与节点输出的值一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:86
#: 3c4f560db90444bfae81f4483c8dc1c4
msgid "Combining DShot and PWM outputs"
msgstr "混合使用 DShot 和 PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:87
#: a9834ce3d99943f5bfeef4660c81393f
msgid ""
"There are a few rules to follow when combining PWM and DShot outputs on the "
"same node. If you are familiar with doing this on autopilot, it is the same "
"rules. The pins are grouped by timer and all of the pins attached to a timer"
" must be the same type. For example, on the MatekL431 node the first 4 "
"outputs are all on the same timer. This means that those output pins must "
"all be DShot outputs and 1 PWM on the fifth output or the first 4 as PWM and"
" 1 DShot."
msgstr ""
"在同一节点上混合使用 PWM 和 DShot "
"输出时需遵循以下几条规则。如果您熟悉在飞控上执行此操作，规则相同。引脚按定时器分组，连接到同一定时器的所有引脚必须使用相同类型。例如，在 "
"MatekL431 节点上，前 4 路输出都在同一定时器上。这意味着这些输出引脚必须全部为 DShot 输出，而第 5 路输出为 PWM，或者前 4 "
"路为 PWM，1 路为 DShot。"
